Healthcare Real-Life Scenario (6 yrs experience)

At my healthcare organization, we built an Enterprise Data Warehouse (EDW) that integrates data from Epic EHR, Claims system, Lab system, and Provider systems.
I worked on loading patient visits, procedures, diagnoses, and billing data into fact tables, and designed dimensions like Patient, Provider, Facility, and Date.
This allowed leadership to analyze readmission rates, length of stay, revenue trends, and quality metrics without impacting production systems.
